@mars/providers-omniroute

This package contains no code copied from OmniRoute. The file
catalog/free-tier-catalog.json is derived data: it is rebuilt by
src/import-cli.ts from the hand-curated free-tier catalog of OmniRoute
(https://github.com/cheaper-inference/OmniRoute, MIT, revision
ad6f33f66bda34eba98645d3bfdabbde294bc843, tag v3.8.52), namely
open-sse/config/freeModelCatalog.data.ts, open-sse/config/freeTierCatalog.ts,
src/shared/constants/providers/web-cookie.ts and
src/shared/constants/providers/noauth.ts. The upstream license is kept at
third_party/omniroute/LICENSE.txt. Quota figures are upstream approximations
curated on 2026-10-19 and are not verified by MARS.
